  "date": "Dec 27, 2024",
  "html": "<p><strong>Every day this year, I set out to read something interesting</strong><span>—or at least remarkable—in pursuit of a simple goal: to stay curious and, hopefully, interesting.</span></p><p><span>Most of what I read had to do with technology, </span><strong>but not always.</strong><span> </span></p><p><strong>The common thread, I’d say, was people who built something.</strong><span> An artifact, a process, a company, a government—you name it.</span></p><p><span>And every day, </span><strong>I jotted down a sentence that resonated with me.</strong></p><p>I kept them all in a small Moleskine notebook I carried everywhere.</p><p>By now, that’s about 366 quotes.</p><p><span>I went back through them, picked a handful of favorites, </span><strong>and turned them into a short digital book for all the subscribers of Artifacts.</strong></p><p>You can read it</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://heyzine.com/flip-book/658df28634.html&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;from here&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://heyzine.com/flip-book/658df28634.html\"><span>from here</span></a></p><p>Or you can download it</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/18I2blZIHEA0-qMDNq00YPP3FVgv27Ir0/view?usp=sharing&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;by clicking here&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/18I2blZIHEA0-qMDNq00YPP3FVgv27Ir0/view?usp=sharing\"><span>by clicking here</span></a></p><div><hr></div><p>This is the cover:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QW02!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2db5c31d-969b-4dfe-acd9-1e5f506c8eb7_744x1054.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QW02!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2db5c31d-969b-4dfe-acd9-1e5f506c8eb7_744x1054.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QW02!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2db5c31d-969b-4dfe-acd9-1e5f506c8eb7_744x1054.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QW02!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2db5c31d-969b-4dfe-acd9-1e5f506c8eb7_744x1054.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QW02!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2db5c31d-969b-4dfe-acd9-1e5f506c8eb7_744x1054.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QW02!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2db5c31d-969b-4dfe-acd9-1e5f506c8eb7_744x1054.png\" width=\"335\" height=\"474.5833333333333\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2db5c31d-969b-4dfe-acd9-1e5f506c8eb7_744x1054.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1054,&quot;width&quot;:744,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:335,&quot;bytes&quot;:286042,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;ali