n.com/image/fetch/$s_!sQRf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3b20c2f-837f-40d5-9e3a-b7a64aff661f_734x1042.png\" width=\"335\" height=\"475.5722070844687\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f3b20c2f-837f-40d5-9e3a-b7a64aff661f_734x1042.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1042,&quot;width&quot;:734,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:335,&quot;bytes&quot;:146492,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sQRf!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3b20c2f-837f-40d5-9e3a-b7a64aff661f_734x1042.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sQRf!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3b20c2f-837f-40d5-9e3a-b7a64aff661f_734x1042.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sQRf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3b20c2f-837f-40d5-9e3a-b7a64aff661f_734x1042.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!sQRf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff3b20c2f-837f-40d5-9e3a-b7a64aff661f_734x1042.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div class=\"subscribe-widget\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidget\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-justifyContent-center pc-reset\"><div class=\"container-IpPqBD\"><form class=\"form form-M5sC90\" action=\"/api/v1/free?nojs=true\" method=\"post\" novalidate=\"\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_url\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_referrer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"current_url\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"current_referrer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_session_url\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"first_session_referrer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referral_code\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"referring_pub_id\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"additional_referring_pub_ids\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source_post_id\"><div class=\"sideBySideWrap-vGXrwP\"><div class=\"emailInputWrapper-QlA86j\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-minWidth-0 pc-position-relative pc-reset flex-auto-UL7Y7f\"><input name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email...\" aria-label=\"Email\" type=\"email\" class=\"pencraft emailInput-OkIMeB input-y4v6N4 inputText-pV_yWb\"></div></div><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft rightButton primary subscribe-btn button-VFSdkv buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\"><span class=\"button-text \">Subscribe</span></button></div><div id=\"error-container\"></div></form><div class=\"animationWrapper-QRL6aQ\"></div></div></div></div><blockquote><h3>Save for Later</h3></blockquote><p><em>I assume you can have a lot of time during holidays :)</em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.interface-eu.org/publications/interfaces-tech-observatory\">What to watch out</a><span> for in the next EU Commission for tech?</span></p><p><span>Why the AI revolution is going to be </span><a href=\"https://stratechery.com/2024/the-gen-ai-bridge-to-the-future/?access_token=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6InN0cmF0ZWNoZXJ5LnBhc3Nwb3J0Lm9ubGluZSIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..NmlVnzkG5C4aeDn-uVNDVN6SMbGuh9iJFp11b5zHTmV95b35QBQ1O4okBe1S16pJhsH-G72Ngq7ST2G9dBOzXHx0y1MEWk1Wdg7C572is4mg0KU-6oAJRZ7iaDh8p6eAJyKCzmkeGZMtESkKRYq_vevYg4mP7cUY1byZRBlXAJ45BnM4CfzlLaQ08Is9yw9qK4a1Y4u8Ovrou7k0Qo0wVqjc_hL2TvrA01pkZtqTveQyw1OJu7fr4an8ZHeNOuyEkV7PrVDfFwf2jbK9GAzyOqYfusNQMmR9Nay689VEdutVhUQMwuPSL26MeY1PT3GCMTDFCHSF-f7LUse_7w_HGg\">an interface revolution.</a><span> And why </span><a href=\"https://www.aisnakeoil.com/p/we-looked-at-78-election-deepfakes?publication_id=1008003&amp;post_id=153082429&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=2d3svm&amp;triedRedirect=true\">disinformation threat</a><span> is not as big as we may think.</span></p><p><span>What </span><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/big-interview-tim-cook-wants-apple-to-literally-save-your-life/\">Tim Cook</a><span> is cooking for us all.</span></p><p><span>How Bluesky is…skyrocketing, </span><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/big-interview-jay-graber-bluesky-2024/\">in the words of their CEO</a><span>.</span></p><p><span>We’re running </span><a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/2024/12/13/24320811/what-ilya-sutskever-sees-openai-model-data-training\">out of data.</a><span> And how to advance </span><a href=\"https://www.projectliberty.io/news/advancing-data-agency/\">data agency &amp; its infrastructure</a><span>.</span></p><p><span>Why </span><a href=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/files/d8lrla4f/staging/1007ade8eb2f028f64631d23430ee834dac17f8e.pdf/Middleware\">something very very technical </a><span>between us and social media can make things better. For feeds and content moderation.</span></p><p><span>Why Substack (yes, the tool I use for this newsletter) is </span><a href=\"http://Death by a thousand substacks\">so bad for publishers</a><span>.</span></p><p><span>What packing for holidays </span><a href=\"https://www.newyorker.com/culture/open-questions/why-cant-you-pack-a-bag\">reveals about us</a><span>.</span></p><p><span>🟢 Join the </span><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Val57bZ4Y9lnnOssMQ2K\">Artifacts Community on WhatsApp</a></strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Val57bZ4Y9lnnOssMQ2K\"> </a><span>to get other Save for Later content!</span></p><blockquote><h3>☕?</h3></blockquote><p>If you want to know more about Artifacts, where it all started, discuss sentences you read, or just want to connect...</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/appointments/schedules/AcZssZ2ibxlzyU7rgnuoTgqXb_DFc19dfHmJeu1OAu17IY0_oHrtcJtvtctAJnMabirgZNx5Z5NAPGs0&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Let's grab a virtual coffee ☕&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/appointments/schedules/AcZssZ2ibxlzyU7rgnuoTgqXb_DFc19dfHmJeu1OAu17IY0_oHrtcJtvtctAJnMabirgZNx5Z5NAPGs0\"><span>Let's grab a virtual coffee ☕</span></a></p>",
  "subtitle": "A few sentences, literally.",
  "text": "Every day this year, I set out to read something interesting—or at least remarkable—in pursuit of a simple goal: to stay curious and, hopefully, interesting.\n\nMost of what I read had to do with technology, but not always.\n\nThe common thread, I’d say, was people who built something. An artifact, a process, a company, a government—you name it.\n\nAnd every day, I jotted down a sentence that resonated with me.\n\nI kept them all in a small Moleskine notebook I carried everywhere.\n\nBy now, that’s about 366 quotes.\n\nI went back through them, picked a handful of favorites, and turned them into a short digital book for all the subscribers of Artifacts.\n\nYou can read it\n\nfrom here\n\nOr you can download it\n\nby clicking here\n\nThis is the cover:\n\nAnd here’s a sample page:\n\nSubscribe\nSave for Later\n\nI assume you can have a lot of time during holidays :)\n\nWhat to watch out for in the next EU Commission for tech?\n\nWhy the AI revolution is going to be an interface revolution. And why disinformation threat is not as big as we may think.\n\nWhat Tim Cook is cooking for us all.\n\nHow Bluesky is…skyrocketing, in the words of their CEO.\n\nWe’re running out of data. And how to advance data agency & its infrastructure.\n\nWhy something very very technical between us and social media can make things better. For feeds and content moderation.\n\nWhy Substack (yes, the tool I use for this newsletter) is so bad for publishers.\n\nWhat packing for holidays reveals about us.\n\n🟢 Join the Artifacts Community on WhatsApp to get other Save for Later content!\n\n☕?\n\nIf you want to know more about Artifacts, where it all started, discuss sentences you read, or just want to connect...\n\nLet's grab a virtual coffee ☕",
  "title": "A gift from builders and makers",
  "url": "https://artifactstech.substack.com/p/a-gift-from-builders-and-makers"
}